        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "About Us"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "Victoria Venezuela Foundation"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit based in Weston, Florida. We provide nutrition, medical care and education to children in Venezuela, and connect US donors with individual children through monthly sponsorship."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Impact"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "What we've accomplished together"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "These numbers represent real children with full bellies, steady heartbeats, and open futures. Every figure here is a life changed."
        },
        {
          "type": "cta",
          "text": "Read The Latest Impact Report",
          "href": "/resources/impact-report-2025"
        },
