          "text": "Connection"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "Build a bond that matters"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "When you sponsor a child, you're not sending money into the void. You're meeting someone. You're writing letters, receiving updates, watching a real person grow. This is personal. This is lasting."
